{
  "$schema": "http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#",
  "title": "G12.7b close-out aggregate evidence",
  "description": "evidence/g12_wave7b_closeout_<UTC>.json。只读汇总八 facts:①9 key(8 P0 + 1 go P1)逐门 PASS(wel 口径 + 顶层 status==pass 字面——G12 证据形态统一无豁免面)+ ②wave2~7a 六聚合/决策门(exit×4 + decisions + soak)全 PASS + ③check_g12_acceptance_map 三向 exit=0 + ④P2 决策表 33 行闭集最终状态无漂移(最新 evidence host_section_pass + FROZEN_IDS 33 行闭集在树)+ ⑤budget_eval --strict 非空零 estimated/skip + ⑥7a full-run 先行(最新 g12_stabilization_soak evidence host_section_pass,base_commit_7a 留痕;立项裁决 7 同日放行)+ ⑦RD 最终状态逐字一致(deferred.json RD-034/039~044 七条目级 status 全 open 逐字 + G12_P2_DECISIONS 33 行 FROZEN_IDS 闭集在树;G12 无 defer 重评窗表,两面一致)+ ⑧生产化差距清单终审锁定(g12_ue_pt_gap_registry.json 10 行闭集:gap_id 集 == G12.4 锁定清单 10 id 逐字对账 + 计数重算一致〔total 10/quality_gap 6/caliber_diff 4,scene_summary cornell-box 4/bistro-interior 6,not_ready_scenes==[]〕+ generated_by == M163 门字面 + quality_gap 6 行超容差项对账齐〔measured_delta 非空 + delta==b−a 可溯源 + g11_anchor 锚定 G15〕+ caliber_diff 4 行残余口径归属非空——残余差距/未闭环行如实登记不冒充全闭环,G-G12-10 字面;终审锁定面 = G13 法定输入)+ 最后新绿 UTC 日留痕。VERDICT=READY|BLOCKED;status flip 独立 commit。",
  "type": "object",
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "required": [
    "schema_version",
    "subject",
    "symbolic_gate_key",
    "matrix_row",
    "wave",
    "numeric_step",
    "source_ref",
    "host_section_pass",
    "device_section_state",
    "verdict",
    "utc_date",
    "last_new_green_utc_date",
    "base_commit_7a",
    "required_gates",
    "extra_facts",
    "subjects",
    "checks",
    "evidence_level",
    "run_url",
    "timestamp",
    "environment",
    "notes"
  ],
  "properties": {
    "schema_version": { "type": "integer", "const": 1 },
    "subject": { "type": "string", "const": "g12_wave7b_closeout" },
    "symbolic_gate_key": { "type": "string", "const": "g12.wave.7b.closeout" },
    "matrix_row": { "type": "string", "const": "G12.7b" },
    "wave": { "type": "string", "const": "G12.7b" },
    "numeric_step": { "type": "integer", "const": 232 },
    "source_ref": { "type": "string" },
    "host_section_pass": { "type": "boolean" },
    "device_section_state": { "type": "string", "enum": ["not_applicable"] },
    "verdict": { "type": "string", "enum": ["READY", "BLOCKED"] },
    "utc_date": { "type": "string", "pattern": "^[0-9]{8}$" },
    "last_new_green_utc_date": { "type": ["string", "null"], "pattern": "^[0-9]{8}$" },
    "base_commit_7a": { "type": ["string", "null"] },
    "required_gates": { "type": "array", "minItems": 15, "maxItems": 15 },
    "extra_facts": { "type": "array", "minItems": 8, "maxItems": 8 },
    "subjects": { "type": "array" },
    "checks": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": [
        "nine_keys_pass",
        "wave_exits_pass",
        "acceptance_map_ok",
        "p2_ok",
        "budget_strict_ok",
        "soak_7a_ok",
        "rd_final_state_ok",
        "gap_registry_locked"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "nine_keys_pass": { "type": "boolean" },
        "wave_exits_pass": { "type": "boolean" },
        "acceptance_map_ok": { "type": "boolean" },
        "p2_ok": { "type": "boolean" },
        "budget_strict_ok": { "type": "boolean" },
        "soak_7a_ok": { "type": "boolean" },
        "rd_final_state_ok": { "type": "boolean" },
        "gap_registry_locked": { "type": "boolean" }
      }
    },
    "evidence_level": { "type": "string", "const": "measured_local" },
    "run_url": { "type": "string" },
    "timestamp": { "type": "string" },
    "environment": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": ["os", "python_version", "cargo_version", "rustc_version"],
      "properties": {
        "os": { "type": "string" },
        "python_version": { "type": "string" },
        "cargo_version": { "type": "string" },
        "rustc_version": { "type": "string" }
      }
    },
    "notes": { "type": "string" }
  }
}
